      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "**Scene: The atmosphere in the boardroom is fraught with tension as the meeting dives deeper into the undercurrents of John’s disdain. He crosses his arms, his expression a mix of irritation and condescension. His gaze drifts over the immigrant team, the subject of their veiled discussion.**\n\n**Executive:**\nAh yes, how I forget, I've observed how all these supposed professionals, not able to grasp this so-called high-intellect. Growing up in a culture that values communal harmony over ruthless ambition is no match for the Darwinian survival of the fittest. Improbable, really, that they are capable of such profound strategic thought here in this cutthroat commercial jungle.\n\n**Board Member 1:**\n(Shaking their head, clearly taken aback by his comment) This is high school level rhetoric, John. It's unfounded and hurtful.\n\n**Executive:**\n(*wringing his hands, defiant*) Too late now. The so-called 'meritocracy' they preach couldn't possibly breed the intellect needed to steer this fine city at the forefront. They come from a world where the head and the heart are not reconciled, and their so-called loyalty is nothing more than a façade.\n\n**",
